# ---- dependencies ----
node_modules/

# ---- build outputs ----
release/
*.exe
*.blockmap

# ---- Tauri / Rust build artifacts (7.7GB after one release build) ----
# 只提交 src/、Cargo.toml/lock、tauri.conf.json、capabilities、dist/（前端副本）。
# 注意 dist/ 是可复制的派生资源，但它需要与 src/renderer 保持逐字节一致，
# 由 tauri-shell/copy-frontend.js 生成，因此入库以便 reviewer 直接看到差异。
tauri-shell/src-tauri/target/
tauri-shell/src-tauri/gen/
tauri-shell/node_modules/
*.pdb

# ---- demo data ----
# 示例项目已不再随包发布。仓库根曾有一个 `demo-projects/` 作为 tauri.conf.json
# `bundle.resources` 的输入，随构建移出资源列表一并删除；它同时还会被运行期/临时
# 脚本写入（`core/seed.js`、`scripts/selftest.js`），因此继续忽略。
# 示例内容的唯一真相是 `scripts/fixtures/`（测试输入），任何同名目录都不入库。
**/demo-projects/
demo/

# ---- 临时探针产物（各子代理调试用，一律不入库）----
.tmp-*

# ---- research / internal working notes (never commit) ----
# Competitive research and internal remediation notes are working documents,
# not project documentation.
docs/COMPETITIVE-MATRIX.md
docs/REMEDIATION-PLAN.md
docs/packaged-screenshot.png

# ---- generated screenshots (reproducible via tauri-shell/shot.ps1) ----
docs/ui-*.png
docs/screenshot.log

# ---- local state & secrets ----
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*credential*
*secret*
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- OS / editor noise ----
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
*.log
*.tmp

# ---- probe / research artifacts ----
docs/probe-*.txt
docs/probe-*.json
docs/dashboard-preview.html

# ---- Tauri externalBin staging (produced by tauri-shell/stage-mcp-bin.js) ----
tauri-shell/src-tauri/binaries/

# ---- owner-only local knowledge base (never commit) ----
# Internal reports, dev-stage screenshots, real-machine verification harness and
# the delivery contract output live here. Public repo carries the product only.
.devkb/
